%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-runtime-functions-prop (関数ページ)
実行ごとに変わる部分は %%% mask / %%% env / %%% variants で扱う (docs/fixtures.md)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::Runtime
output application/dw
---
{ "props" : prop("user.timezone") }
%%% env
TZ=Asia/Tokyo
%%% output application/dw
{
  props: "Asia/Tokyo"
}
